      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ray Cooke Auctioneers proudly present this fantastic half acre site in Blackdown, Kilteel, Co. Kildare. The site is situated on a peaceful and picturesque edge of Kilteel, the location is next to none you are mere 10 minutes from Kill and Rathcoole Villages and all they have to offer including wide array of local amenities including schools, shops, Avoca and Rathcoole Park along with a host of bus routes, the N7 &amp; M50 road networks. Sold as seen and not subject to planning permission.\r\n\r\nThis provides the perfect opportunity for anyone looking to build their own home, the site is in a zoned residential area and with the correct planning and guidance you could build your dream home here.\r\n\r\nDirections If travelling through Rathcoole Village turn left just before The Poitin Still and proceed ahead onto kilteel Road. Continue straight, passing Beech Park Golf Club on your right-hand side follow the road for another 2.5km where you can turn right onto Blackdown where the site is clearly sign posted down the end."
      }
